                    <p class="font-weight-semibold m-0">The quick brown fox — 600 <code class="text-nowrap">font-weight-semibold</code></p>
                    <p class="font-weight-bold m-0">The quick brown fox — 700 <code class="text-nowrap">font-weight-bold</code></p>
