    </div>
    <div class="pa-card__body">
        <div class="d-flex flex-column gap-sm">
            <p class="text-lead m-0"><code>text-lead</code> — an introductory paragraph at 16px with relaxed line-height, for the opening sentence of a section.</p>
            <p class="text-caption m-0"><code>text-caption</code> — small muted text at 12px, for figure captions and fine print.</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

